Changes: mechanically extracted 245 geographic CLDR region identifiers, calling codes, mobile patterns and example numbers; excluded non-geographic region001; removed XML formatting whitespace from patterns and changed representation to Dart constants. Country display names use system country-name facts and common localized labels.
No general national-number parser or national-prefix transformations are included. Canonical mobile format validation is not proof of number ownership, reachability or SMS availability. Country identifiers are CLDR regions, not a guarantee of exhaustive ISO-3166-1 coverage.
